  "title": "TWFG, Inc. To Announce First Quarter 2026 Financial Results on Thursday, May 7, 2026",
  "summary": "THE WOODLANDS, Texas, April 20, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TWFG, Inc. (NASDAQ: TWFG), a leading independent insurance distribution platform, announced today that it will release its financial results for the first quarter ended March 31, 2026, after the market closes on Thursday, May 7, 2026.",
